# MSP mass-to-database matcher (v1.0.0)

A lightweight Python script for matching experimental precursor ions from an MSP file against theoretical molecular weights in two local compound databases (Excel format). The match tolerance is **20 ppm**. Only compounds with retention time > 2 minutes are considered.

---

## Version
**v1.0.0** (2026-07-31)

